      "source": "Add <a href=\"SimpleAsyncTaskSchedulerCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.task\"><code>customizers</code></a> that should be applied\nto the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a>.",
