    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"SimpleAsyncTaskSchedulerCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.task\"><code>customizers</code></a> that should be\napplied to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a>.",
      "translation": "设置要应用于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a> 的 <a href=\"SimpleAsyncTaskSchedulerCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.task\"><code>customizers</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"SimpleAsyncTaskSchedulerCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.task\"><code>customizers</code></a> that should be\napplied to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a>. Customizers are applied in the\norder that they were added after builder configuration has been applied. Setting\nthis value will replace any previously configured customizers.",
      "translation": "设置要应用于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a> 的 <a href=\"SimpleAsyncTaskSchedulerCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.task\"><code>customizers</code></a>。自定义器在构建器配置应用后，按照添加的顺序进行应用。设置此值将替换任何先前配置的自定义器。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Add <a href=\"SimpleAsyncTaskSchedulerCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.task\"><code>customizers</code></a> that should be applied\nto the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a>. Customizers are applied in the order that\nthey were added after builder configuration has been applied.",
      "translation": "添加应在应用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a> 后应用的 <a href=\"SimpleAsyncTaskSchedulerCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.task\"><code>customizers</code></a>。自定义器在构建器配置应用之后，按照添加的顺序进行应用。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "In a typical auto-configured Spring Boot application this builder is available as a\nbean and can be injected whenever a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a> is needed.",
      "translation": "在典型的自动配置的 Spring Boot 应用程序中，该构建器作为 Bean 可用，每当需要 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a>` 时，都可以注入它。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Build a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a> instance and configure it using this\nbuilder.",
      "translation": "构建一个新的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a> 实例，并使用此构建器进行配置。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the provided <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a> instance using this\nbuilder.",
      "translation": "使用此构建器配置提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the task decorator to be used by the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将任务装饰器设置为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/concurrent/SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskScheduler</code></a> 所使用的装饰器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the concurrency limit.",
      "translation": "设置并发限制。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the task termination timeout.",
      "translation": "设置任务终止超时时间。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
